    </a>

    <a href="#tips">
      Tips
    </a>

    <a href="#faq">
      FAQ
    </a>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- =====================================
     MAIN CONTENT
===================================== -->

<main>

  <div class="container">


    <!-- =================================
         APPLICATION STEPS
    ================================== -->

    <section
      class="section searchable"
      id="steps"
    >

      <div class="section-heading">

        <h2>
          How to Apply
        </h2>

        <p>
          Follow these steps from
          preparation to submission.
        </p>

      </div>


      <div class="steps">

        <article class="step">

          <div class="step-number">
            01
          </div>

          <h3>
            Choose a Programme
          </h3>

          <p>
            Find a university and programme
            that matches your academic
            background, career goals and
            budget.
          </p>

        </article>


        <article class="step">

          <div class="step-number">
            02
          </div>

          <h3>
            Check Requirements
          </h3>

          <p>
            Review academic, language,
            financial and country-specific
            requirements before applying.
          </p>

        </article>


        <article class="step">

          <div class="step-number">
            03
          </div>

          <h3>
            Prepare Documents
          </h3>

          <p>
            Collect certificates, transcripts,
            identification, references and
            any required supporting documents.
          </p>

        </article>


        <article class="step">

          <div class="step-number">
            04
          </div>

          <h3>
            Submit Application
          </h3>

          <p>
            Complete the application form,
            upload your documents and submit
            before the official deadline.
          </p>

        </article>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =================================
         REQUIREMENTS
    ================================== -->

    <section
      class="section searchable"
      id="requirements"
    >

      <div class="section-heading">

        <h2>
          Common Requirements
        </h2>

        <p>
          Requirements vary by institution,
          programme and country.
        </p>

      </div>


      <div class="guide-grid">

        <article class="guide-card">

          <div class="guide-icon">

            <i
              class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"
            ></i>

          </div>

          <h3>
            Academic Qualifications
          </h3>

          <p>
            You may need certificates,
            diplomas or degrees that meet
            the institution's entry requirements.
          </p>

        </article>


                <article class="guide-card">

          <div class="guide-icon">

            <i
              class="fa-solid fa-comments"
            ></i>

          </div>

          <h3>
            Application Support
          </h3>

          <p>
            Get guidance on preparing your
            application, understanding
            requirements and organizing
            your supporting documents.
          </p>

        </article>


        <article class="guide-card">

          <div class="guide-icon">

            <i
              class="fa-solid fa-globe"
            ></i>

          </div>

          <h3>
            Study Abroad Applications
          </h3>

          <p>
            Learn about the key steps involved
            when applying to universities
            outside your home country.
          </p>

        </article>


        <article class="guide-card">

          <div class="guide-icon">

            <i
              class="fa-solid fa-award"
            ></i>

          </div>

          <h3>
            Scholarship Applications
          </h3>

          <p>
            Prepare a stronger scholarship
            application by understanding
            eligibility, documents and deadlines.
          </p>

        </article>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =================================
         APPLICATION TIMELINE
    ================================== -->

    <section
      class="section searchable"
      id="timeline"
    >

      <div class="section-heading">

        <h2>
          Application Timeline
        </h2>

        <p>
          A simple timeline to help you stay
          organized throughout the process.
        </p>

      </div>


      <div class="steps">

        <article class="step">

          <div class="step-number">
            01
          </div>

          <h3>
            Research
          </h3>

          <p>
            Compare programmes, universities,
            tuition fees, entry requirements
            and available funding.
          </p>

        </article>


        <article class="step">

          <div class="step-number">
            02
          </div>

          <h3>
            Prepare
          </h3>

          <p>
            Gather your certificates,
            transcripts, identification,
            references and other documents.
          </p>

        </article>


        <article class="step">

          <div class="step-number">
            03
          </div>

          <h3>
            Apply
          </h3>

          <p>
            Complete the official application
            form carefully and upload every
            requested document.
          </p>

        </article>


        <article class="step">

          <div class="step-number">
            04
          </div>

          <h3>
            Follow Up
          </h3>

          <p>
            Monitor your email and application
            portal for updates, requests and
            admission decisions.
          </p>

        </article>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =================================
         COMMON MISTAKES
    ================================== -->

    <section
      class="section searchable"
      id="mistakes"
    >

      <div class="section-heading">

        <h2>
          Common Application Mistakes
        </h2>

        <p>
          Avoid these common problems before
          submitting your application.
        </p>

      </div>


      <div class="tips">

        <article class="tip">

          <div class="tip-icon">

            <i
              class="fa-solid fa-clock"
            ></i>

          </div>

          <div>

            <h3>
              Missing the Deadline
            </h3>

            <p>
              Do not wait until the final day.
              Give yourself enough time to
              handle unexpected problems.
            </p>

          </div>

        </article>


        <article class="tip">

          <div class="tip-icon">

            <i
              class="fa-solid fa-file-circle-xmark"
            ></i>

          </div>

          <div>

            <h3>
              Missing Documents
            </h3>

            <p>
              Review the official checklist
              carefully before submitting.
            </p>

          </div>

        </article>


        <article class="tip">

